@startuml
title UC-06 - AI suggestions with current catalog verification
skinparam shadowing false
actor Customer
participant "AI screen / aiApi" as UI
participant AiController as CTRL
participant RecommendationService as SVC
participant "SupabaseGateway / Auth" as DB
participant "Gemini / FoodTools / Embeddings" as AI
Customer -> UI : Message + delivery point
UI -> CTRL : POST /api/ai/chat/stream\nJWT + question + limited history
CTRL --> UI : SSE status
CTRL -> SVC : stream(...)
SVC -> DB : Authenticate token
DB --> SVC : User session or error
SVC -> SVC : Rate limit / worker capacity
alt Unavailable, unauthorized or over limit
  SVC --> CTRL : ApiFailure
  CTRL --> UI : HTTP error / SSE error as applicable
else Accepted
  SVC -> DB : Check index availability
  SVC -> AI : Generate / invoke food search tool
  AI -> DB : Match vectors and filters
  DB --> AI : Candidate foods
  AI -> DB : Recheck current price / availability / range
  DB --> AI : Verified foods
  AI --> SVC : Text and bounded food results
  SVC --> CTRL : onText / onResult
  CTRL --> UI : SSE delta / result
  UI -> UI : Validate result schema
  UI --> Customer : Message + up to 5 food cards
end
note over Customer,UI
Customer opens a food and checks out separately.
AI does not create orders.
end note
@enduml
